  "interpretation": "Packed RG ETC1S increases coverage and height error and is rejected. The 12K R8 field improves native texture and saves memory but regresses the wide scene even without compression. Native 16K monochrome AVIF is the selected experimental source: all three browser engines retain more genuine non-polar source detail. Polar imagery retains its original 8K detail, so the lossless 8K polar control can outperform compressed candidates. Acceptance remains subject to actual scenes, performance, constrained textures, photography, offline delivery and upgrade checks.",
